<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;">COURAGE suggests muscle preservation m=
ay become a clinically differentiated add-on for older or sarcopenic patients=
. Commercial relevance remains unproven: preserving imaging-derived lean mass=
 matters only if it improves strength, mobility, frailty or long-term outcome=
s enough to justify an additional biologic.</p>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;"><strong>What to watch next</strong></p>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;">Retatrutide=E2=80=99s active-comparato=
r and outcomes data; regulatory filing expected in early 2027; and trevogruma=
b studies enriched for older adults with objectively reduced muscle mass or s=
trength.</p>
<h4 style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:#1=
2395b;margin:16px 0 6px;">Kodiak has converted retinal durability from promis=
e into pivotal evidence</h4>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;"><strong>What changed</strong></p>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;">In Phase 3 DAYBREAK, both Kodiak=E2=80=
=99s Zenkuda and anti-VEGF/IL-6 bispecific tabirafusp-ted were noninferior to=
 aflibercept on one-year vision outcomes in wet age-related macular degenerat=
ion. Fifty-four percent of Zenkuda patients reached 24-week dosing under trea=
t-to-dryness criteria, with no reported intraocular inflammation. Kodiak plan=
s a multi-indication Zenkuda BLA in the fourth quarter. (<a href=3D"https://k=
odiak.gcs-web.com/news-releases/news-release-details/zenkuda-and-tabirafusp-t=
ed-meet-primary-endpoints-pivotal" style=3D"color:#1a5e9a;text-decoration:und=
erline;">kodiak.gcs-web.com</a>)</p>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;"><strong>What it tells us</strong></p>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;">The six-month durability result is com=
mercially meaningful and explains the sharp repricing of Ocular Therapeutix i=
n the supplied watchlist: sustained-delivery retinal therapies now face a pot=
entially simpler injectable biologic with five positive Phase 3 studies.</p>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;">Tabirafusp-ted=E2=80=99s differentiati=
on is less clear. Kodiak disclosed noninferior vision and anatomical success =
but no convincing evidence yet that IL-6 blockade improves outcomes beyond VE=
GF inhibition; planned post hoc subgroup analyses reinforce that uncertainty.=
</p>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;"><strong>What to watch next</strong></p>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;">The Zenkuda label, actual injection di=
stribution beyond the 54% reaching six months, and whether tabirafusp-ted dem=
onstrates prospective superiority in diabetic macular edema.</p>
